 you have some gold objectives and you  have some silver objectives uh the gold  objectives are the main quest  the silver objectives are side things  and then you have those extra tails  which are extra  side objectives in one big open world  that does  slowly kind of open up a bit more seems  like that's what halo infinite is  basically going to be  from everything that i can tell and from  what i asked it is supposed to be a sort  of broad  expansive world a full sandbox with a  bunch of stuff for players to discover  but there is still absolutely a very um  they said epic  personal story so very much a story  focus uh it would just be that if you  want to go do a main story  mission you just go and do that but you  can also  play around in the sandbox or do side  quests if you want to  again like a ghost of tsushima there are  obviously many other games that do that  i am kind of getting anthem vibes where  that is concerned i did ask if there was  a hub location and they didn't answer  but yeah some important things to note  is that it seems like you don't actually  have to do the story missions you can  kind of just do whatever if you don't  want to do them but if you do  they have put a hell of a lot of effort  into that story uh you only play  as a spartan there is split screen a  four-player co-op in any one world  and you would all be spartans so it's  not like some of you would be some other  character  um the pilot who is the guy that let's  just stop playing the trailer i'm  excited to see it  in 4k let's make sure we're actually  playing  no no no no no no we gotta go we gotta  actually 4k this  like i've seen so this is the pilot um  he's supposed to be a very important  character i think he's gonna be like yo  cortana he's the human  to balance out the chief they said he's  like the most normal guy they could have  made  but obviously bertsa back they did say  that uh  brutes will be able to throw grunts at  you  um yeah i was going to say i saw people  complain that they didn't think that the  graphics were  good frankly people were saying they  think the graphics are bad and i just  don't  have any problem with it because to me  it looks like classic halo so that's  what i want i guess um but this is  uh in progress they did say it's an led  but i'm very much cool with how it looks  so yeah it is a chief centric story it  is a sequel to halo 5  but it is very much focused on the  future and they did say that you will  absolutely not need to have played any  other halo game to be able to  understand this game though if you  haven't i recommend that you do  i don't [ __ ] with four or five so much  but the early halo games including  reaching odst  good stuff  uh and the main thing that they just  kept pressing on was  this technology will save humanity from  what i can tell as a response to  criticism um is we built this to be a  love-lettered halo this is  very much a uh spiritual sequel  sorry no spiritual reboot they were so  focused on making sure it feels like  halo and i was actually told  i cannot fail  no not officially that um  halo infinite was delayed was originally  going to come out sooner but they  reworked the story because  the fan response to halo 5 was fairly  negative so they they kind of  re-envisioned things and and are really  kind of restarting  it's nothing halo it's just insane that  that's  this is such a good one you step inside  um yeah they said it's the most open  expansive environment they've ever  created  several times larger than the last two  campaigns put together  which is nuts um there's a new equipment  system with the sandbox obviously the  drop shield and the grapple which is  called the grapple shot  uh there's a new audio engine i feel  like that's most of the news that i got  and um i did just interview aaron  greenberg  on youtube.com inside gaming check it  out and obviously you know  pass for a release date they just not  given it to us yet uh i feel like  there's going to be another showcase  maybe at some point  which it seems crazy to get this many in  a year but  that seems to be the approach so we'll  probably find out  i think the halo infinite obviously a  launch title um release date alongside  the price of the xbox series x probably  at the same time  but yeah mostly just wanted to try to  explain a little bit about how uh  the open world is going to work it is  very much a system where you you know  run into objectives or set a point on a  map and then  navigate and explore as you go that's  absolutely the goal which is definitely  a change to halo that i initially was  very against but then when i think about  you know ghost tsushima was still a  satisfying story to me so i feel like  halo probably will be able to pull this  off especially when you think about  halo's focus on vehicles halo has always  been fun to traverse  uh i've had instances where you know  it's been scripted that i have to get  out of a scorpion and i'm kind of  annoyed about it because i was like  but i want to keep using my tank whereas  i feel like  they are very much taking advantage of  the plethora  of vehicles and how much fans love those  vehicles when approaching this  so yeah that's most of the information  keeping this largely fact-based um  not very opinionated on this one i guess  it i realized today that there are a lot  of people who really want to hate this  game which is cool  uh you do you fam and if you like halo  that's also cool  i don't feel like i'm necessarily 100  sold on this but  um i'm more interested in playing halo  infinite than i was in  ever touching halo 5 which you know i  have touched but  but these are just some extra facts i  got for you all  if you have any questions i will do my  best to answer them below um because i  did get to talk to  you know microsoft employees for about  an hour total  today across everything i can't promise  that i can answer everything but i'll do  my best so  that's it for this quick video i am  happy to  be i don't know kind of excited about  halo again  it feels good to me man and i think that  that's because it does look like classic  halo  so i am cool with it alrighty guys i  will see you all next time

